# This project is same-origin (docs/DESIGN_DECISIONS.md Q34): the Vite dev proxy
# forwards API/WebSocket traffic to FastAPI, and production is served from one
# origin — so there are normally no environment variables to set here.
#
# Only add a file if you deliberately run the frontend on a different origin
# than the API, e.g.:
# VITE_DEV_API_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8000